    "rating": 4.8,
    "reference": "ChIJQ6UHFys2yUwR-UqETlclKvM",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Laurie-Anne Ranger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108830555804450245371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH_Nk_W1NyCkKI0IXhPbkw98twuBXOu8MqJF2RclIQIVNmfTw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We are thorougly satisfied by the service and results of our new stair bannisters and the sanding of our floors.  Every member of their team was excellent and we are very happy with the results. Removing our 1980's stairs took many years off the age of our house. The sanding of our living room floor followed by the finish to match stairs and the new floors in the upper levels was flawless.  We love everything they did.  We wholeheartedly  recommend them.",
        "time": 1719865481,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Zoe Atsaidis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100330032749367312591/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLHqU4o48sXgOl1lLfUorqlJtFbfqqZs5bsTllIqyWif9X_Sw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "We are very happy that we chose Planchers Mtl Ouest for the sanding and staining of our floors. They worked quickly & efficiently and checked in with us to make sure we were happy throughout the process. Our floors look beautiful! Definitely recommend & would use them again in the future. Thank you to Maxime & his team!",
        "time": 1749474424,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Bourbonnais",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111191914792347639104/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJce6YxcVOHB_ZafbOvhpUuRJDclzkK5MdMPzUR9wHnvTieIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Maxime showed at the appointed time to give me a quote, since it was a simple banister repair his colleague did the work immediately, no waiting.\nThe job was well done and professional, extremely courteous, they even took time to play with my dog.\nI highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1732635725,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Wei Yue",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112886453611697834004/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVI67i3oJ4OoYScf6fCHEwE3qoekzykrNIrQWGHTlJQW750YdCr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Let me start off this review by stating that Maxime and his team never did any work at our home.\nThe service I have received was limited to the assessment of damages to our floor, his expert opinion on how to best address the issue and two separate quotes based on varying degrees of work to be done. While I cannot comment on the craftmanship of Planchers Montréal Ouest, I can attest that communicating with Maxime was very smooth and straightforward. He was also super punctual for the appointment despite our request coming in on short notice. I want to highlight the fact that Maxime actually declined taking on the job as our floor is quite special and requires specific treatment. He highlighted all the risk with detailed explanations and put us in contact with the manufacturer of the flooring. To me, this is a testament that he prioritizes the customer’s best interest over a quick buck. I would contact Maxime again without hesitation knowing that he will only accept jobs where he can guarantee the highest quality results.",
        "time": 1732736149,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "N. A.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110137174442866953859/reviews",
